{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cf8hGDmgfVj1NavFV1BQT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! The implementation is complete and all tests pass. Let me create a summary of what was implemented:\n\n## Summary of Changes\n\nI've successfully implemented all three features specified in BE-005:\n\n### 1. **Partial Fulfilment**\n- Added `quantity` field to both Order and Shipment (defaults to 1, validates ≥ 1)\n- Added `Fulfilment` object to Order with `allocated`, `delivered`, and `status` fields\n- Added `FulfilmentStatus` enum: `UNALLOCATED`, `PARTIALLY_ALLOCATED`, `FULLY_ALLOCATED`, `DELIVERED`\n- Added shipment transitions: `/confirm`, `/deliver`, `/cancel` endpoints\n- Added `DELIVERED` status to shipment lifecycle\n- Implemented allocation logic: shipments are rejected (409) if they exceed order quantity\n- Cancelling shipments releases their quantity (excluded from allocation calculation)\n- Added `fulfilment` filter to `GET /orders?fulfilment=STATUS`\n\n### 2. **Customer Validation**\n- Orders are rejected (422) when created for non-existent customers\n- Updated `GET /customers/{customerId}` to return 404 with error envelope (consistent error format)\n- Updated `OrderControllerTest` to create customers before orders\n- Added `CUSTOMER_NOT_FOUND` error code\n\n### 3. **Pagination**\n- All list endpoints support `limit` (1-100, default 100) and `offset` (0+, default 0)\n- Added `X-Total-Count` header to all paginated responses\n- Lists are sorted by ID\n- For orders, total count is calculated after the fulfilment filter\n- Invalid pagination parameters are rejected with 400\n\n### Key Implementation Details\n- Added `UnprocessableEntityException` for 422 responses (customer validation)\n- Extended repositories with helper methods (e.g., `findByOrderId`)\n- Fulfilment status is calculated on-the-fly based on current shipment state\n- All error responses use the consistent ApiException envelope\n- No new Maven dependencies were added\n- All changes are within the order, shipment, customer features and shared API package\n\n**Test Results:** All 13 tests pass ✓"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1418,"cache_read_input_tokens":63639,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1418},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ad6a9872-6977-488f-a991-df679e89e8ed","uuid":"490aa1c4-a3cc-45a6-9e4d-79962f1ccff7","timestamp":"2026-09-17T08:27:50.094Z","request_id":"req_011Cf8hGDLdEmH3h1Htw4qZc"}
